How can I identify and tokenize parts of speech in a sentence using C++ programming language? Can you provide an example code using Natural Language Processing (NLP) libraries such as Stanford CoreNLP or NLTK?
Here is an example code using Stanford CoreNLP library:
#include <iostream>
