This code uses the Stanford CoreNLP library to tokenize the sentence and identify the part of speech for each word. The code first creates a pipeline and adds the POS processor to it. The pipeline is then used to process the input text, and the resulting document is split into sentences. For each sentence, the words and their associated POS tags are printed to the console.

