   const taggedWords2 = tagger.tag(tokens2);
   ```

   You can then iterate over the tagged words to identify the use of imagery and symbolism. For example, if you find that both poems use tree imagery to convey a sense of beauty or majesty, you can note that as a similarity between the two poems.

   To analyze the meter and rhyme scheme, you can use the CMU Pronouncing Dictionary, also included in the natural library:
   ```javascript
   const cmuDict = new natural.CMUDict();
