Long-term analysis:
1. Import the data:
```
data = readtable('volcano_data.csv');
```
2. Calculate the cumulative ash depth over time:
```
cumulative_ash_depth = cumsum(data.Ash_Depth);
```
3. Plot the cumulative ash depth over time:
```
plot(data.Time, cumulative_ash_depth);
xlabel('Time (days)');
ylabel('Cumulative Ash Depth (mm)');
title('Long-term effects of volcanic eruptions on ash depth');
```
4. Fit a linear regression model to the data:
```
mdl = fitlm(data.Time, cumulative_ash_depth);
```
5. Calculate the slope and intercept of the regression line:
```
